{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1000_p", "source_sha256": "7e543d4384be557c971669af66ba372fc03e6a5acf3952dfc8a6d35ba6d5b7f9", "ja": "（先日のお雛さまライブ成功のお礼にと、立派な\n雛人形をいただいたが、どこに飾るか……うーん）", "zh": "（为了感谢我们前些日子的女儿节演出大获成功，收到了做工精美的女儿节人偶，可该摆在哪里呢……嗯——）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "9aa1c74608df3b3ccaefa28ab20eea2415f3fc579f5c95fae25598705c8226ed", "ja": "やっほー兄ちゃーん、遊びにきたよ～！\n……って、ありり？　それ、お雛さま？", "zh": "呀吼——哥哥，我们来找你玩啦～！\n……咦？那个是女儿节人偶？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1002_012mam", "source_sha256": "19ebd03fcdac2768da2bfa67fe15a18d2a11f9523a27c961d4b7725cc68c7240", "ja": "そんなの持って、兄ちゃんもついに乙女に！？\nまさかアイドルデビュー！？　宿命のライバル！？", "zh": "拿着那种东西，哥哥终于也要变成少女了吗！？\n难道要出道当偶像！？成为宿命的对手！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1003_p", "source_sha256": "97eb17c74536ef4be6ca2e24442e1794d23c2ade7749bc920b1641ec455d6114", "ja": "ならないし、デビューもしないぞ。これは貰い物。\n……ちなみに、真美は雛人形の飾り方、知ってるか？", "zh": "才不会变成那样，也不会出道。这是别人送的。\n……顺便问一下，真美知道女儿节人偶该怎么摆吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1004_012mam", "source_sha256": "6718fe0777e95ea2e9ef0219f3575b1a31854c70e1801fdfcfae627ae815a069", "ja": "もちろん！　真美だってリッパなせくしー女子だよ？\n飾り方くらい知ってるよ、当然っしょ？", "zh": "当然啦！真美也是出色的性感女生哦？\n摆放方法什么的，当然知道啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0c0c48299d8450271a951a7ca00e62885a0b61e7aa5210a541ab21e4bb87049e", "ja": "おっ、さすがだな。ならそんなセクシー女子の真美に\n雛人形を飾るの手伝ってもらおうかな。", "zh": "哦，不愧是你。那就让身为性感女孩的真美来帮我摆放女儿节人偶吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1006_012mam", "source_sha256": "2b3917d00d5523f3829333ec66c26f210a57650919ed560c37e7c191e5d06bb8", "ja": "合点しょーちの助さん留さん！　この雛人形マイスター\nの真美が、お雛さまをずドドンと飾ってあげ……", "zh": "包在真美身上！就让雏人偶大师\n真美我，轰轰烈烈地把雏人偶摆好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1007_se", "source_sha256": "f3aadf65bed3f47e4b0570292c696c57bb0da8178836deafe5fb33c8eae0b4b8", "ja": "ひょいっ", "zh": "轻轻一跃", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "9c8ee0b36ae3189f7af84c8ad1724e999f0a1e199a2deaa0034e7234f7509628", "ja": "あり？　ちょっと兄ちゃ～ん。\nなんで渡してくんないの？", "zh": "咦？哥哥——\n为什么不交给我？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1009_p", "source_sha256": "8599cbb4dd2cdba1e48c5ff942efeec9af179d612353175d0969746d3516888c", "ja": "念の為に言っておくが……飾るだけでいいんだぞ？\nイタズラとか、余計なことはしなくていいからな？", "zh": "我先说清楚啊……只要挂好装饰就行了哦？\n可别搞什么恶作剧，不要做多余的事啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "1f9674528482530de7a2b1860a90eb82eb4a9174feff9995c2875a463d9b98ff", "ja": "え～！　ヒドイよ兄ちゃん！\nそれは良いガッカリってもんだよ！？", "zh": "诶～！太过分了，哥哥！\n那可是让人很失望的好事啊！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1011_p", "source_sha256": "93882f5d2e5e895912e527da82cb497b07614e4e69e08fcb9904bd67d06cdbcd", "ja": "……言いがかり？", "zh": "……强词夺理？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1012_012mam", "source_sha256": "a5a7790fc87dc48445564e8e73d268c2a58c4f668cb48be38c8d0356304cf1a7", "ja": "そうそれ！\nさすがの真美も、そんなバチ当たりじゃないかんね！", "zh": "对对，就是这样！\n就连真美也没那么不知天高地厚啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1013_p", "source_sha256": "d211518a62dbc15cbff1c4be190e8317f987c1bf7bef8d94936a9069e11b12d6", "ja": "……まぁ、確かにそれもそうか。\nごめんごめん、疑って悪かったよ。", "zh": "……嗯，你说得也有道理。\n抱歉抱歉，是我不该怀疑你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1014_012mam", "source_sha256": "9a5b3a557265786712ac26b080911c14cccb266b5e431ebdd1b0ad27bef46cbb", "ja": "わかればよろしい。……んじゃ、お雛サマ貸して？\n真美がキレイにお化粧直しして飾ってあげる！", "zh": "明白就好。……那，雏人偶借我一下？\n真美来帮她画个美美的妆摆起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1015_p", "source_sha256": "549a4f59139e4f64d3c498c0dda466d0d42fa7b12c695a315596c6b27200bd8e", "ja": "はい、それじゃ……って、まて！　つまり落書き\nするつもりだったんだな！　やっぱり没収！", "zh": "好，那就……等等！也就是说，你本来是打算涂鸦的吧！果然还是没收！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "c1fb2be87182a1dfd6f289915063a092567d2232e764802c86672ffcb80bd64b", "ja": "うあうあ、勢いでいけると思ったのにー！\n兄ちゃんのいけず～。兄ちゃん様は、いけずですっ。", "zh": "呜啊呜啊，明明以为趁着这股气势就能蒙混过去的——！哥哥真坏～。哥哥大人真是坏心眼！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1017_p", "source_sha256": "f94cc94dec587501733b7758b11685979998b0e2ec0192a9630fea6109cfe99b", "ja": "わざわざ貴音っぽく繰り返すんじゃない！\nまったく、油断もスキもないな。", "zh": "别特意学贵音那样重复啊！\n真是的，完全不能有丝毫松懈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1018_012mam", "source_sha256": "d8952c6ee14244c0091d81f04ba9410b47603133074d8901518e7cf180ffba8b", "ja": "いいもーんだ。真美を倒しても、\n今度は第二第三の真美が立ちはだかるかんね！", "zh": "哼，我才不在乎呢——就算打倒了真美，接下来还会有第二个、第三个真美挡在你面前呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "f79058d090eb003308a73610e66ebf2c492dcdcab48df77eeecb2fd611ea1306", "ja": "それまで兄ちゃんは、隣を空けて待っているがよい！\nでは、サラバダー！", "zh": "在那之前，哥哥就空出身边的位置等着吧！\n那么，再会啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0153_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0153_1020_p", "source_sha256": "816566a12eddad5d310f6bea6270d0353acbb0a8a9d31fc45677b07e4991e4a9", "ja": "こら待て！　いったい何回チャレンジするつもり……\nん？　俺の隣がどうしたって？", "zh": "喂，等等！你到底打算挑战多少次……嗯？我旁边怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
